1
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,000
Now be a good thrall,

2
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:42,479
join the rest

3
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:44,000
and go seed chaos in Jingdu.

4
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,639
Hold on to me.

5
00:02:58,080 --> 00:03:00,039
Tinghui, stay conscious.

6
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,680
Come on!

7
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:11,919
Sire.

8
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:13,879
Stay with me.

9
00:03:28,879 --> 00:03:29,520
Bo!

10
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:37,800
Sire.

11
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:38,960
I'm afraid..

12
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:44,039
I can't protect you anymore...

13
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,039
Bo!

14
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,800
Bo!

15
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,399
Tinghui,

16
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,279
come on.

17
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:29,759
Tinghui!

18
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:31,079
Sir,

19
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,839
we are under siege.

20
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:34,040
Please withdraw!

21
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,439
Baron?

22
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,720
Baron?

23
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:39,720
Search every inch.

24
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,959
I want him found,

25
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:41,959
alive or dead.

26
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:43,120
Yes.

27
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,399
Commandant.

28
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,319
Keep your eyes peeled.

29
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,000
Aye, sir.

30
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:19,839
There's a blood trail.

31
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,240
Who are you?

32
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,480
Why are you after me?

33
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,199
Something's up over there.

34
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:54,399
Go after it.

35
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,439
Still breathing.

36
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,240
Take him in.

37
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,800
It's been three days.

38
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,759
Why isn't she coming to?

39
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:29,360
Sire,

40
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,160
the arrow cut

41
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,319
deep in the chest,

42
00:08:32,439 --> 00:08:34,160
just wide of her heart.

43
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,560
It's a miracle she's even alive.

44
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,399
A full recovery

45
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:39,559
will take

46
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,960
quite a while to come by.

47
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,200
Does her condition have

48
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,639
anything to do with

49
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:45,000
excessive Godsgrain intake?

50
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,039
Sire.

51
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,600
I've been inspecting her for a while.

52
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:50,159
No trace of

53
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,559
Godsgrain residue in her system so far.

54
00:08:52,799 --> 00:08:53,960
Lady Meng's symptoms

55
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:56,039
are a far cry from Miss Yan's.

56
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:59,279
In fact, it was caused by her severe weapon wound.

57
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:09,600
However rare the herbs might be,

58
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,600
no matter how extreme you have to go,

59
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,480
please see to it

60
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,480
that she's cured.

61
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,559
I need her back

62
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:18,039
in one piece.

63
00:09:19,279 --> 00:09:21,720
I shall do my best, Sire.

64
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,399
Bo?

65
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:55,840
Guards.

66
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,360
Sire.

67
00:09:58,799 --> 00:10:00,080
Any lead on Commander?

68
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,480
Sire.

69
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:03,279
Commandant Di's been searching.

70
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,519
Zhishu.

71
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:17,879
I've got Tinghui's

72
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:19,600
essentials and favorite snacks.

73
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,360
But she still won't wake up.

74
00:10:22,679 --> 00:10:24,399
She must've felt the same when I was in a coma.

75
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,200
How did she pull through?

76
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,600
She used to stay beside me all night.

77
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,759
I guess it's my turn now.

78
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:33,240
But I'm so scared.

79
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:36,399
I've never felt worse.

80
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,200
She's weathered many storms,

81
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,120
and come out unscathed.

82
00:10:41,399 --> 00:10:42,960
She'll rise above this one, too.

83
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:52,480
After all these trials,

84
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:55,200
we should learn to cherish those beside us.

85
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,840
Promise me.

86
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:58,480
Take care of yourself.

87
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:07,799
He's dead.

88
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,000
My lord.

89
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,559
Will you please knock?

90
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,679
I saw your correspondence with Northsunder.

91
00:11:18,799 --> 00:11:20,720
Are you advising a royal marriage?

92
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,159
You broke into my study again?

93
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,120
That's not the point.

94
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,159
I'm here to warn you.

95
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,240
The Northsunder Priestess is, after all, an outsider.

96
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,200
She might be lady of the inner court,

97
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,840
but she'll never pledge allegiance.

98
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,120
To keep a tight rein on the Empress-to-be,

99
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:37,480
your best bet is Shen Zhili.

100
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,919
Since when could a woman

101
00:11:42,039 --> 00:11:43,360
lecture in politics?

102
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,399
Do I have to

103
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:46,720
remind you how you become what you are?

104
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,679
Quit acting high and mighty.

105
00:11:49,279 --> 00:11:50,519
You stole my father's credit in

106
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:51,840
containing the flood

107
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,440
the year he drowned.

108
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,720
If not for him,

109
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,320
you'd never be "the youngest Chancellor ever".

110
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,159
All these years,

111
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,639
I've kept the secret all to myself.

112
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,960
I'm even paving way for your career.

113
00:12:02,279 --> 00:12:03,960
You used us without batting an eye.

114
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,919
I don't see why you're flinching now.

115
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:08,320
Don't you dig up the past again.

116
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,759
This is a matter of state.

117
00:12:11,759 --> 00:12:13,200
You stay out of it.

118
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:15,919
Now look in my eyes

119
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,799
and tell me you're not holding back

120
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:19,399
because you want her to your own.

121
00:12:19,919 --> 00:12:20,679
Outrageous.

122
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,120
I've got work to do.

123
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,120
I'm not wasting my breath on you.

124
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:27,440
What is this, then?

125
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,919
Gu Qin, oh Gu Qin...

126
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,279
Before I came,

127
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:31,320
I lied to myself that

128
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:32,440
if you'd nominate

129
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,600
Shen Zhili as the Empress,

130
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,120
I'd turn a blind eye to

131
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,200
all your sordid secrets.

132
00:12:36,279 --> 00:12:37,759
I was dead wrong.

133
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,120
You just have to have her,

134
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:39,879
don't you?

135
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,279
They are

136
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:44,360
just portraits used for teaching.

137
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:45,840
Oh, yeah?

138
00:12:46,279 --> 00:12:47,799
Go on. Keep hiding them.

139
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,799
You're so pathetic

140
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,440
you can't

141
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,440
even own up to

142
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,720
your perverted desires.

143
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,519
Hell, you even

144
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:55,000
gave me one when we were young!

145
00:12:58,799 --> 00:12:59,559
Lingyi...

146
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:00,840
If the Priestess nods,

147
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,279
this could be a peace offering,

148
00:13:02,399 --> 00:13:03,799
and the throne's consent is in the bag.

149
00:13:04,039 --> 00:13:05,960
In Great Ning, she's high and dry.

150
00:13:06,159 --> 00:13:06,759
If I could

151
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:08,000
be the first one to reach out,

152
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,679
she's on my side.

153
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,360
Lingyi,

154
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,039
