155
00:13:13,039 --> 00:13:14,679
I know you're better than this.

156
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,440
Now I'm

157
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,600
your wife all of a sudden?

158
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,559
To ascend,

159
00:13:27,559 --> 00:13:29,320
