160
00:13:29,679 --> 00:13:30,879
With my father gone,

161
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:31,919
you just bare your teeth

162
00:13:31,919 --> 00:13:33,720
and suck us dry.

163
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:43,200
Lingyi,

164
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,759
I've been swamped with work.

165
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,240
You understand, don't you?

166
00:13:47,559 --> 00:13:48,960
It's been a decade since we married.

167
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:49,919
We are both

168
00:13:49,919 --> 00:13:51,360
not who we were anymore.

169
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,799
We've long grown out of it.

170
00:13:53,799 --> 00:13:55,240
So what's the use of

171
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,600
