172
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,200
Exactly.

173
00:13:57,759 --> 00:13:58,840
I've strayed far from who I was.

174
00:13:59,039 --> 00:13:59,679
I hate myself

175
00:13:59,679 --> 00:14:00,840
for becoming a harpy,

176
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,240
but it's all thanks to you.

177
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,120
Gu Qin.

178
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:07,480
You lied to me, gave me the cold shoulder,

179
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,159
and imprisoned me in this manor...

180
00:14:09,159 --> 00:14:10,519
You might as well just kill me!

181
00:14:11,399 --> 00:14:12,480
To think the way you throw

182
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,600
yourself at Shen Zhili!

183
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,000
The set piece of your

184
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,039
damn poets, portraits and lutes that won me over

185
00:14:17,639 --> 00:14:18,600
in the first place,

186
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:20,080
you're now trying on her!

187
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,000
So help me, I'll go out there

188
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,120
and let the court know

189
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,159
how the dignified Chancellor Gu

190
00:14:25,159 --> 00:14:26,440
is tutoring his protégés

191
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,120
behind closed doors!

192
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:27,720
Shut up!

193
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,960
Shut your mouth!

194
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,320
Ten years.

195
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,399
Every single day, you've been watching me,

196
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,360
nitpicking

197
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,759
every trivial thing I do.

198
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,279
You enjoy triumph.

199
00:14:37,279 --> 00:14:38,159
You revel in it.

200
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,720
If our union was a mistake,

201
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,799
it's time to annul it.

202
00:14:49,559 --> 00:14:50,919
There. You finally said it.

203
00:14:50,919 --> 00:14:51,600
Admit it!

204
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,799
It's because my family

205
00:14:53,799 --> 00:14:54,679
