206
00:14:54,759 --> 00:14:55,759
to you anymore, isn't it?

207
00:14:56,759 --> 00:14:57,879
And I've lost my looks.

208
00:14:57,879 --> 00:14:59,440
I pale next to Shen Zhili.

209
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:01,559
The Shen family is riding high now.

210
00:15:01,679 --> 00:15:02,559
They're the talk of the town.

211
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,840
So you're itching to

212
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,159
