213
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,480
You're impossible!

214
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,360
It's all about you.

215
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,720
You parade around like a noble heiress,

216
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,759
haughty and insufferable.

217
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,919
You throw a tantrum at absolutely nothing.

218
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,159
I've never asked you

219
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:18,759
to be the perfect wife.

220
00:15:19,039 --> 00:15:20,080
But you've given me

221
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,799
no heir, no lineage.

222
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,080
And you're obsessed with

223
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,240
some superstitious crap,

224
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,840
making me a laughingstock at court.

225
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,720
What a disgrace!

226
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,159
And whose fault is that?

227
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:31,679
It's you.

228
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,799
You never come to my chambers,

229
00:15:35,159 --> 00:15:36,759
always making excuses.

230
00:15:36,759 --> 00:15:38,480
Now you're actually blaming me?

231
00:15:40,399 --> 00:15:41,639
Gu Qin.

232
00:15:42,399 --> 00:15:43,360
You are just

233
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,840
a selfish piece of trash.

234
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,480
The feelings you have for Shen Zhili?

235
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,679
It's all a sham too.

236
00:15:47,879 --> 00:15:49,960
You'll never love anyone but yourself,

237
00:15:50,039 --> 00:15:51,600
a good-for-nothing lice

238
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,240
making a ladder of every woman you meet.

239
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,159
Did you just slap me?

240
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:07,320
You actually slapped me.

241
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,679
Gu Qin, hear me well.

242
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:18,639
As long as I am still

243
00:16:18,639 --> 00:16:19,720
drawing breath,

244
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:21,720
I will never,

245
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,240
ever yield my place to Shen Zhili.

246
00:16:51,039 --> 00:16:51,720
Sire.

247
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,200
The court cannot go leaderless.

248
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,720
You haven't held court

249
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,720
for days now.

250
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,320
State affairs are piling up.

251
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,000
And besides...

252
00:17:00,759 --> 00:17:02,279
You've been

253
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:04,360
by Lady Meng's side for days.

254
00:17:04,759 --> 00:17:05,360
This...

255
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:08,799
this simply defies protocol!

256
00:17:08,879 --> 00:17:11,000
Lady Meng rooted out the Tiger Roar Gang

257
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:13,359
and took an arrow for me.

258
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,960
Am I now to be scolded

259
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,680
for merely visiting a heroine?

260
00:17:18,559 --> 00:17:19,839
I'm transgressing, Sire.

261
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,119
Lady Meng's valor is inscribed

262
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:22,119
in heaven and earth.

263
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,640
B-But Sire,

264
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,200
you've been here for nights on end.

265
00:17:25,359 --> 00:17:27,039
I'm concerned

266
00:17:27,039 --> 00:17:28,519
for your health.

267
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:31,400
I humbly beg you to return

268
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,559
and rest for now.

269
00:17:32,839 --> 00:17:34,720
It would be more appropriate to wait

270
00:17:35,039 --> 00:17:37,759
until Lady Meng has recovered.

271
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,799
Sire, Steward You,

272
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:46,359
please return to the palace.

273
00:17:46,359 --> 00:17:47,319
I'll stay.

274
00:17:47,319 --> 00:17:48,400
She is in good hands.

275
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:48,960
She's right, Sire.

276
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,720
We won't let anything

277
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:51,960
happen to her.

278
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,599
If there's something wrong,

279
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,440
report to me.

280
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:57,359
We shall.

281
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,680
Miss Yan,

282
00:18:06,599 --> 00:18:07,599
the other day,

283
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:09,359
I stored a chest of storax at Bofeng,

284
00:18:09,599 --> 00:18:10,519
when I was making

285
00:18:10,519 --> 00:18:11,759
the antidote there.

286
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:13,279
It can revive the senses.

287
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,559
It might help.

288
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:17,880
Really?

289
00:18:18,279 --> 00:18:19,240
I'll go get it now.

290
00:19:20,559 --> 00:19:21,559
You're awake, my lady!

291
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,920
I had

292
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,559
such a terrible,

293
00:19:33,119 --> 00:19:34,920
wild dream.

294
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:49,920
Come in.

295
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:51,559
Fuzhi.

296
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,119
Take off your robe.

297
00:19:57,799 --> 00:19:58,720
Uh...

298
00:19:59,039 --> 00:20:00,440
In broad daylight?

299
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:02,240
Miss Yan, you're so eager.

300
00:20:02,839 --> 00:20:04,039
I'm starting to blush.

301
00:20:04,039 --> 00:20:05,039
Zhishu.

302
00:20:05,359 --> 00:20:06,160
Quit the act.

303
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:09,079
Let me see it.

304
00:20:25,359 --> 00:20:26,039
Fuzhi.

305
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:28,119
I'm sorry.

306
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:30,319
I made you cry again.

307
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,599
I should be the one apologizing.

308
00:20:39,079 --> 00:20:40,279
How can I not notice

309
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,240
how badly you were hurt...

310
00:20:47,279 --> 00:20:48,240
A man has got to

311
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,480
have a few scars

312
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,240
to prove his mettle.

313
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:53,680
Zhishu.

314
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:55,480
Listen up.

315
00:20:55,799 --> 00:20:56,359
You don't get to

316
00:20:56,359 --> 00:20:57,680
monopolize your body like this.

317
00:20:58,519 --> 00:21:00,319
After you came back from Shazhou,

318
00:21:00,319 --> 00:21:01,480
half of it became mine.

319
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,079
Next time you

320
00:21:04,519 --> 00:21:05,960
fail to preserve your body,

321
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,240
or put it in danger,

322
00:21:08,359 --> 00:21:09,440
or make it bleed—

323
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:11,480
I'm not letting you off.

324
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:14,359
I'm sorry.

325
00:21:22,559 --> 00:21:24,480
If you do this to yourself again,

326
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:27,119
I'll find a dozen

327
00:21:27,119 --> 00:21:28,240
hot young guys just to

328
00:21:28,839 --> 00:21:29,640
get on your nerves.

329
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,000
I wouldn't dare.

330
00:21:31,559 --> 00:21:32,559
My lady's word

331
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:33,880
outweighs my life.

332
00:21:34,119 --> 00:21:35,200
What did you just call me?

333
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,880
We're not even married yet.

334
00:21:41,559 --> 00:21:42,599
Soon we will be.

335
00:22:05,880 --> 00:22:07,440
Why did you kill Baron?

336
00:22:08,559 --> 00:22:09,480
Lyu Da?

337
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,559
You're still alive.

338
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,720
Surprised?

339
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:25,880
You're wounded.

340
00:22:26,079 --> 00:22:26,519
I have

341
00:22:26,519 --> 00:22:27,759
salve in my study.

342
00:22:27,839 --> 00:22:28,079
I'll fetch...

343
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:29,319
Save your act.

344
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:31,559
I followed the assassin

345
00:22:31,559 --> 00:22:32,519
all the way here.

346
00:22:34,279 --> 00:22:37,039
Who'd have thought Baron would be killed

347
00:22:37,039 --> 00:22:38,400
by his own heartless brother.

348
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,799
But it's your turn now.

349
00:22:41,759 --> 00:22:43,160
You can keep him company,

350
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:45,000
on the road to the next life.

351
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:45,640
Lyu Da.

352
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:47,440
I had no choice.

353
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,359
You saw it yourself.

354
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:50,400
He'd gone completely mad.

355
00:22:50,519 --> 00:22:52,039
I've kept all the silver he gave me

356
00:22:52,319 --> 00:22:53,200
over the years,

357
00:22:53,839 --> 00:22:55,640
more than enough to rebuild the Gang.

358
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:56,799
You'll be the new Baron.

359
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:59,000
And I'll be your patron.

360
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,799
The underworld of Jingdu

361
00:23:01,599 --> 00:23:02,960
will be named after you.

362
00:23:06,279 --> 00:23:07,400
What you want

363
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:10,319
is just another lap dog.

364
00:23:10,799 --> 00:23:12,599
Mad as he was,

365
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:13,680
he was still

366
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:15,799
your own flesh and blood.

367
00:23:15,799 --> 00:23:17,359
Go to hell!

368
00:23:21,119 --> 00:23:22,519
He brought it on himself.

369
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,720
I warned him long ago:

370
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,640
stay away from Godsgrain.

371
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:28,720
If he'd just listened,

372
00:23:29,519 --> 00:23:31,359
we wouldn't have ended up like that.

373
00:23:31,359 --> 00:23:32,799
He got to where he is

374
00:23:33,319 --> 00:23:34,960
all because of you, bastard.

375
00:23:35,279 --> 00:23:37,799
You pushed him down this path.

376
00:23:38,119 --> 00:23:40,400
He saw you as his only family.

377
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:44,079
Lyu Da, oh, Lyu Da.

378
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:46,279
You have no blood ties to him.

379
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,200
Why bother defending him

380
00:23:48,599 --> 00:23:50,359
when you can rule in his place?

381
00:23:50,359 --> 00:23:51,640
Twelve years ago,

382
00:23:51,759 --> 00:23:53,400
I was on the run, hunted by my enemies.

383
00:23:54,039 --> 00:23:55,960
He pulled me out and gave me a shelter

384
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:56,920
from a pile of corpses.

385
00:23:57,759 --> 00:24:00,119
This life of mine has belonged to him since then.

386
00:24:00,759 --> 00:24:01,960
You may not claim him

387
00:24:02,039 --> 00:24:03,079
as your brother.

388
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:05,200
Well, I do.

389
00:24:07,039 --> 00:24:08,960
He was always so sentimental,

390
00:24:09,359 --> 00:24:11,079
so that he let you use him

391
00:24:11,079 --> 00:24:12,519
over and over again.

392
00:24:13,799 --> 00:24:15,160
My lady, take it easy.

393
00:24:17,559 --> 00:24:18,200
My lady.

394
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,720
You're sensitive to everything now.

395
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:21,200
And it looks like it's

396
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:22,480
about to rain any moment.

397
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,240
Shall we head back inside?

398
00:24:24,279 --> 00:24:25,000
It's alright.

399
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,799
I want him to hear this good news

400
00:24:26,799 --> 00:24:27,759
from me first.

401
00:24:28,279 --> 00:24:29,039
Doukou,

402
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:30,200
can you bring me

403
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,480
some sour plums?

404
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:32,559
Right away.

405
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:41,960
You asked my brother

406
00:24:42,079 --> 00:24:43,680
to kidnap your wife,

407
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:46,240
just so you could play the hero.

408
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:49,200
Then you set eyes upon the chancellorship,

409
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,160
imploring him

410
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:51,480
to kill your father-in-law...

411
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:06,440
My lord...

412
00:25:06,759 --> 00:25:07,519
Lingyi.

413
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:09,000
What you just said...

414
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:11,319
Say it again.

415
00:25:19,119 --> 00:25:19,920
Lady Yuan.

416
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:22,640
Right on time.

417
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,440
Here's something you should know:

418
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:25,759
Your husband

419
00:25:25,799 --> 00:25:27,200
has a younger half-brother,

420
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:28,240
born of one father.

421
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:30,319
He had that brother

422
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,759
murder your father.

423
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,160
And all these years,

424
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:37,640
he's been playing the part

425
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:39,319
of a devoted son and husband right beside you.

426
00:25:53,519 --> 00:25:54,519
Lingyi.

427
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:57,359
Everything he said is a lie.

428
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,680
Ten years...

429
00:26:04,359 --> 00:26:05,640
It's been ten years!

430
00:26:07,119 --> 00:26:07,720
I've been

431
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:09,720
living in a web of lies you carefully spun.

432
00:26:10,359 --> 00:26:11,720
The life-saving favor?

433
00:26:12,119 --> 00:26:13,640
The courtship?

434
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:15,079
All of it was calculated!

435
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:16,680
My father—

436
00:26:17,279 --> 00:26:18,839
the night he died,

437
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:21,000
you held me in your arms

438
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:22,720
and said you'd take care of me for life.

439
00:26:23,039 --> 00:26:24,920
That was a lie, too!

440
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:29,279
Lingyi.

441
00:26:30,839 --> 00:26:32,960
How can you believe the ramblings of a madman?

442
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:35,559
I'm your beloved husband!

443
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:40,519
But you didn't just set me up.

444
00:26:41,119 --> 00:26:41,599
You also

445
00:26:41,599 --> 00:26:43,039
had to kill my father for nothing!

446
00:26:43,440 --> 00:26:44,319
Why? Say something!

447
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:48,039
He treated you like his own.

448
00:26:48,599 --> 00:26:49,240
If only he

449
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:51,039
knew he was murdered by the man he trusted most...

450
00:26:51,359 --> 00:26:52,440
Did he deserve it?

451
00:26:54,519 --> 00:26:55,200
Gu Qin.

452
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:56,359
You've been

453
00:26:56,359 --> 00:26:58,319
keeping up this lie for ten years.

454
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:00,599
Those forced tears always came in handy!

455
00:27:01,599 --> 00:27:02,759
Turns out I've never

456
00:27:02,759 --> 00:27:04,279
truly known you.

457
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:06,240
What other filthy deeds

458
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,400
have you done

459
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,880
behind my back?

460
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:12,599
Oh.

461
00:27:13,839 --> 00:27:14,519
Am I

462
00:27:14,519 --> 00:27:16,000
going to be the next victim?

463
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:23,279
That must be it.

464
00:27:25,359 --> 00:27:26,319
With me out of the way,

465
00:27:29,799 --> 00:27:31,119
you'll have every reason

466
00:27:31,119 --> 00:27:32,480
to be with Shen Zhili.

467
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,880
Lingyi. Lingyi!

468
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,039
I swear. My heart is yours.

469
00:27:40,039 --> 00:27:42,279
He was just driving a wedge between us.

470
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:46,039
Please have faith in me, honey!

471
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,680
Let's just move on, alright?

472
00:27:52,039 --> 00:27:53,440
We can build our life anew.

473
00:28:09,079 --> 00:28:10,920
Stay back! Don't come any closer!

474
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,720
You're a monster in human skin!

475
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:15,759
Ling Yunfei is in the Bureau right now.

476
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:17,799
I'm going to tell Meng Tinghui

477
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,119
and Shen Zhili just how you

478
00:28:19,559 --> 00:28:20,960
slaughtered your father-in-law

479
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:22,240
and deluded the throne.

480
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,480
I'm going to

481
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:25,359
avenge my father!

482
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,640
Dear Buddha,

483
00:28:58,119 --> 00:28:59,200
I vow to honor you.

484
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:00,599
Pray pity me.

485
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,279
Please grant me a son

486
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,799
to carry on the Gus' line.

487
00:29:24,519 --> 00:29:27,039
The Chancellor is destined to have a son.

488
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:29,359
It's just

489
00:29:30,079 --> 00:29:31,640
his fortune and life may be short-lived.

490
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,799
My lord.

491
00:29:33,279 --> 00:29:34,680
We will have a child.

492
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,960
I've fought so hard

493
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:48,279
to get

494
00:29:48,279 --> 00:29:49,559
where I am.

495
00:29:50,279 --> 00:29:51,480
Why can't you

496
00:29:52,359 --> 00:29:54,039
just leave me alone?

497
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:56,119
My lord.

498
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,640
I will die regretting the moment

499
00:30:00,319 --> 00:30:02,680
we were under the peach blossoms

500
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,279
where you told me you loved me

501
00:30:06,640 --> 00:30:08,759
and I fell for it.

502
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:19,720
Only when I'm with you

503
00:30:20,559 --> 00:30:22,119
can I be myself.

504
00:30:24,119 --> 00:30:25,559
I want to be the one to keep you safe.

505
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:29,480
Will you

506
00:30:30,079 --> 00:30:31,039
take that leap for me?

507
00:31:12,519 --> 00:31:13,640
Guards!

508
00:31:14,839 --> 00:31:16,480
Assassin!

509
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:19,359
Lingyi's been stabbed!

510
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,920
Assassin!

511
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:24,400
They stabbed my wife!

512
00:31:24,410 --> 00:31:26,880
My wife's been stabbed!

513
00:31:51,839 --> 00:31:52,440
Qing?

514
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:53,319
The files.

515
00:31:58,039 --> 00:31:58,920
I'm being seri...

516
00:32:05,599 --> 00:32:07,400
Ling Yunfei is captivated.

517
00:32:07,880 --> 00:32:08,680
The people of Skyvale

518
00:32:08,680 --> 00:32:09,799
have all been settled.

519
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:11,240
Your priority is rest

520
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,480
until you're fully recovered.

521
00:32:24,599 --> 00:32:26,000
Ling Yunfei was caught.

522
00:32:27,119 --> 00:32:28,680
But we're still in the dark.

523
00:32:29,599 --> 00:32:31,400
For one, I took Godsgrain as well.

524
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:32,599
Why wasn't I affected?

525
00:32:33,279 --> 00:32:34,640
Who else can control the thralls

526
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,640
besides Ling Yunfei?

527
00:32:37,079 --> 00:32:38,960
Why did they go straight for you, leaving me alone?

528
00:32:39,279 --> 00:32:40,240
And what do those assassins

529
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:42,559
have to do with the Tiger Roar Gang?

530
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:44,079
The physician examined you.

531
00:32:44,640 --> 00:32:46,400
There's no poison left in your system.

532
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:49,240
Maybe you were born with

533
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:51,640
a resistance to Fairbane.

534
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,839
Remember what I told you

535
00:32:53,839 --> 00:32:54,799
about Midvale?

536
00:32:55,039 --> 00:32:55,880
It's time

537
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:56,880
you knew the full story.

538
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:59,279
After Midvale fell,

539
00:32:59,599 --> 00:33:00,680
a few of the survivors

540
00:33:00,799 --> 00:33:01,400
banded together

541
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:03,020
and called themselves Crimson Conclave.

542
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:04,920
They've lain low for years,

543
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:06,920
heart bent on restoring their kingdom.

544
00:33:07,759 --> 00:33:08,880
Those assassins...

545
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:11,319
They are all members of the Conclave.

546
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:12,920
That's why they're coming after you.

547
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:14,640
And...

548
00:33:15,519 --> 00:33:16,440
That arrow...

549
00:33:16,450 --> 00:33:17,240
Which you

550
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:19,279
shouldn't have taken for me.

551
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:24,880
You've been unconscious for days.

552
00:33:25,839 --> 00:33:27,240
And Bo went missing.

553
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,319
I was terrified...

554
00:33:31,599 --> 00:33:32,799
Terrified that I won't be able

555
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,519
to see you ag...

556
00:33:34,519 --> 00:33:35,240
Sire.

557
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,240
Bo's body

558
00:33:37,839 --> 00:33:38,519
has been found.

559
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:30,480
Please do not.

560
00:34:31,199 --> 00:34:32,960
His body is sabotaged.

561
00:34:33,639 --> 00:34:34,880
It might distress Your Majesty.

562
00:35:08,159 --> 00:35:09,039
Bo's sword has

563
00:35:10,199 --> 00:35:11,280
also been recovered.

564
00:35:49,639 --> 00:35:50,960
Within these walls and beyond,

565
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,360
no one will ever

566
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,559
keep me company

567
00:35:57,559 --> 00:35:58,360
the way you did.

568
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,199
Bo.

569
00:36:01,039 --> 00:36:01,679
You always

570
00:36:01,679 --> 00:36:02,960
learned the rules by heart.

571
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:05,280
To lie injured before His Majesty is a grave disrespect!

572
00:36:06,119 --> 00:36:07,880
Get up and apologize to His Majesty!

573
00:36:08,280 --> 00:36:08,920
Bo.

574
00:36:10,719 --> 00:36:11,760
Rest in peace.

575
00:36:12,599 --> 00:36:13,599
We'll take it from here.

576
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:16,519
I promise to safeguard His Majesty,

577
00:36:17,199 --> 00:36:18,519
just like you always did.

578
00:36:22,280 --> 00:36:23,840
By my decree:

579
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:26,960
Posthumously confer upon Commander Huang Bo

580
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:28,800
the title of General Divine Guardian.

581
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:30,880
He shall receive a grand burial

582
00:36:30,880 --> 00:36:33,559
in a blessed plot outside the Western Mausoleum,

583
00:36:34,119 --> 00:36:36,599
as a tribute to his immortal deeds and eternal glory.

584
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,599
Yes.

585
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,639
A wound kept hidden

586
00:38:14,679 --> 00:38:16,119
will only flare up.

587
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,360
It's the same with pain.

588
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:20,079
The more you withhold it,

589
00:38:20,599 --> 00:38:21,559
the deeper it cuts.

590
00:38:22,559 --> 00:38:24,039
I share your sorrow.

591
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:26,559
Xiang died protecting me.

592
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:30,440
Fuzhi almost died because of me too.

593
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:32,480
This kind of agony renders

594
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:36,800
the survivors' life a living hell.

595
00:39:20,559 --> 00:39:21,920
A tiny would like this

596
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,639
can bleed one dry.

597
00:39:25,119 --> 00:39:26,320
Imagine when a heart is broken.

598
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:31,679
Sire.

599
00:39:32,679 --> 00:39:34,599
Maybe it would help to let it out.

600
00:39:41,039 --> 00:39:42,679
My father taught me from boyhood:

601
00:39:44,199 --> 00:39:45,360
set aside personal feelings,

602
00:39:46,519 --> 00:39:47,599
and serve the greater good.

603
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,440
For twenty years,

604
00:39:50,559 --> 00:39:53,599
I have grown to be cold and distant, concealing all my

605
00:39:54,679 --> 00:39:55,719
vulnerabilities.

606
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:01,559
I kept everyone at arm's length.

607
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,679
I never expected

608
00:40:04,679 --> 00:40:06,880
anyone to understand my isolation.

609
00:40:08,559 --> 00:40:10,840
I wouldn't let anyone sway my heart.

610
00:40:18,760 --> 00:40:20,440
But no matter how hard I try,

611
00:40:26,320 --> 00:40:28,400
someone always finds a way to break it apart.

612
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:31,079
And make me care.
